{"outcome":"component","existing":"","reason":"","code":"CompanyTimeline","label":"Company timeline","description":"The history of a company as a vertical timeline, each milestone a date, a title and a short text joined by a line. Use it on an about page or a story page to tell how the company grew year by year.","props":"[{"name": "title", "type": "text", "label": "Heading", "max": 120}, {"name": "intro", "type": "html", "label": "Introduction", "help": "A short text shown under the heading, before the timeline."}, {"name": "events", "type": "items", "label": "Milestones", "min": 2, "max": 24, "items": [{"name": "date", "type": "text", "label": "Date", "help": "A year, a month or a period, as it should be read.", "required": true, "max": 40}, {"name": "title", "type": "text", "label": "Title", "required": true, "max": 120}, {"name": "text", "type": "html", "label": "Text"}]}]","sample":"{"title": "Notre histoire", "intro": "<p>De l’atelier familial à la boutique en ligne, voici les grandes étapes de notre aventure.</p>", "events": [{"date": "1987", "title": "L’ouverture de l’atelier", "text": "<p>Marie et Jean Lefèvre ouvrent un petit atelier de reliure à Lyon. Ils travaillent à deux.</p>"}, {"date": "1995", "title": "La première boutique", "text": "<p>L’atelier devient une boutique sur les pentes de la Croix-Rousse. Les premiers carnets sur mesure voient le jour.</p>"}, {"date": "2008", "title": "Le lancement du site", "text": "<p>Nos carnets se vendent en ligne dans toute la France. L’équipe compte désormais huit personnes.</p>"}, {"date": "2016", "title": "Un nouvel atelier", "text": "<p>Nous nous installons dans un atelier plus grand, alimenté en énergie renouvelable.</p>"}, {"date": "2023", "title": "L’ouverture à l’Europe", "text": "<p>Nous livrons maintenant dans douze pays d’Europe, toujours depuis Lyon.</p>"}]}","template":"<section class="timeline">{% if props.title is not empty %}<h2 class="timeline__title">{{ props.title }}</h2>{% endif %}{% if props.intro is not empty %}<div class="timeline__intro">{{ props.intro }}</div>{% endif %}<ol class="timeline__list">{% for event in props.events %}<li class="timeline__event"><p class="timeline__date">{{ event.date }}</p>{% if props.title is not empty %}<h3 class="timeline__event-title">{{ event.title }}</h3>{% else %}<h2 class="timeline__event-title">{{ event.title }}</h2>{% endif %}{% if event.text is not empty %}<div class="timeline__text">{{ event.text }}</div>{% endif %}</li>{% endfor %}</ol></section>","css":".timeline__title { margin: 0 0 1rem; }
